{
    "title": "Speedway: Rewards & Shopping",
    "description": "Earn Points. Get rewards. The official app of Speedway and Speedy Rewards lets you start earning on the fuel and merchandise you already buy. Members can redeem those points for coupons towards their favorite items or get discounts on gas with our fuel rewards.\r\n\r\n<b>Monthly Perks</b>\r\n\u25cf    Choose your own Monthly Perk \u2013 Either a Merchandise Perk or Fuel Perk\r\n\u25cf    Make a qualifying purchase and your reward is automatically applied\r\n\u25cf    Check back each month for new Perks\r\n\r\n<b>App Only Speedy Deals</b>\r\n\u25cf    Clip app exclusive coupons to get great deals on your favorite products like pizza, beer, wine, coffee, and many more\r\n\r\n<b>Gas Savings And Fuel Rewards</b>\r\n\u25cf    Gas Price Search helps navigate to a gas station with cheap gas prices near you\r\n\u25cf    Select a Fuel Perk each month to accelerate your gas rewards\r\n\u25cf    Earn gas rewards when shopping at our grocery partners like Remke, Martin\u2019s, Family Fare, Buehler\u2019s, and many more\r\n\r\n<b>Speedy Rewards Clubs</b>\r\n\u25cf    Buy any 6 Coffee, Fountain, Speedy Freeze, tea or specialty drink and receive a reward of your choice\r\n\u25cf    Car Wash Club \u2013 Buy 6 car washes and receive a coupon for your 7th car wash free\r\n\u25cf    Exclusive coupons and savings\r\n\r\n<b>Store Locator</b>\r\nFind the closest Speedway store or gas station and filter by amenities like car wash, ATM, and diesel gas.\r\n\r\n<b>Bonus Points</b>\r\n\u25cf    Earn 10 points per gallon of gas and 20 points per dollar spend on merchandise\r\n\u25cf    Each month you can get Bonus Points offers on select items\r\n\r\n<b>Speedy Cash On The Go</b>\r\nYou can buy and reload your Speedy Cash Gift Card from the Speedway mobile app so your stops at Speedway are Speedy Fast! Gift cards can be used on all Speedway purchases, excluding restricted items.\r\n\r\n<b>What Can I Do With My Points?</b>\r\n\u25cf    Get free stuff \u2013 Redeem your points to receive a coupon, or pay for select items at the register\r\n\u25cf    Enter to win \u2013 Every month there are exciting Speedy Rewards Sweepstakes\r\n\u25cf    Get merchandise \u2013 Redeem your points to get even more of the product you love\r\n\r\n<b>Android Exclusives</b>\r\nAdd home screen widgets to display your Speedy Rewards Card or favorite stores along with current gas prices.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Earn Points. Get rewards. The official app of Speedway and Speedy Rewards lets you start earning on the fuel and merchandise you already buy. Members can redeem those points for coupons towards their favorite items or get discounts on gas with our fuel rewards.<br><br><b>Monthly Perks</b><br>\u25cf    Choose your own Monthly Perk \u2013 Either a Merchandise Perk or Fuel Perk<br>\u25cf    Make a qualifying purchase and your reward is automatically applied<br>\u25cf    Check back each month for new Perks<br><br><b>App Only Speedy Deals</b><br>\u25cf    Clip app exclusive coupons to get great deals on your favorite products like pizza, beer, wine, coffee, and many more<br><br><b>Gas Savings And Fuel Rewards</b><br>\u25cf    Gas Price Search helps navigate to a gas station with cheap gas prices near you<br>\u25cf    Select a Fuel Perk each month to accelerate your gas rewards<br>\u25cf    Earn gas rewards when shopping at our grocery partners like Remke, Martin\u2019s, Family Fare, Buehler\u2019s, and many more<br><br><b>Speedy Rewards Clubs</b><br>\u25cf    Buy any 6 Coffee, Fountain, Speedy Freeze, tea or specialty drink and receive a reward of your choice<br>\u25cf    Car Wash Club \u2013 Buy 6 car washes and receive a coupon for your 7th car wash free<br>\u25cf    Exclusive coupons and savings<br><br><b>Store Locator</b><br>Find the closest Speedway store or gas station and filter by amenities like car wash, ATM, and diesel gas.<br><br><b>Bonus Points</b><br>\u25cf    Earn 10 points per gallon of gas and 20 points per dollar spend on merchandise<br>\u25cf    Each month you can get Bonus Points offers on select items<br><br><b>Speedy Cash On The Go</b><br>You can buy and reload your Speedy Cash Gift Card from the Speedway mobile app so your stops at Speedway are Speedy Fast! Gift cards can be used on all Speedway purchases, excluding restricted items.<br><br><b>What Can I Do With My Points?</b><br>\u25cf    Get free stuff \u2013 Redeem your points to receive a coupon, or pay for select items at the register<br>\u25cf    Enter to win \u2013 Every month there are exciting Speedy Rewards Sweepstakes<br>\u25cf    Get merchandise \u2013 Redeem your points to get even more of the product you love<br><br><b>Android Exclusives</b><br>Add home screen widgets to display your Speedy Rewards Card or favorite stores along with current gas prices.",
